    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13944" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσφρά̄γ-ισμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>impression of a seal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>Ep.Traj.</u>
				74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.585d
			</span></i>; also, <i>the seal itself, signet,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Je.</u>
				22.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sealed copy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12(7).237.69
			</span></i> (Amorgos, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>stamped receipt</i> for goods taken, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				31.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>.</div>
